        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "6 個月前",
        "rating": 4,
        "text": {
          "text": "🇭🇰鰂魚涌粉嫩𝐜𝐚𝐟𝐞💕\n\n✤ 宇治抹茶鮮奶 $49\n畫上精緻飛馬拉花\n光看外皮已是頂級\n味道濃郁口感細滑\n𝐌𝐚𝐭𝐜𝐡𝐚 𝐥𝐚𝐭𝐭𝐞 topped with an intricate Pegasus latte art that’s almost too pretty to drink🦄 Vibrant matcha flavour with a smooth, velvety mouthfeel🍵\n\n✤ 羽衣甘藍沙冰 $68\n點了較健康的沙冰\n味道天然帶點甜味\n很清爽適合夏天喝\nOpted for the healthier 𝐒𝐮𝐩𝐞𝐫 𝐆𝐫𝐞𝐞𝐧 — naturally sweet with pure, clean fruit flavours and incredibly refreshing 🌱🍎🥥\n\n✤ 挪威煙三文魚吞拿魚酸種包 $108\n賣相出色的酸種包\n口感香脆帶點鹹香\n配上健康新鮮沙律\nStunning 𝐬𝐦𝐨𝐤𝐞𝐝 𝐬𝐚𝐥𝐦𝐨𝐧 𝐬𝐨𝐮𝐫𝐝𝐨𝐮𝐠𝐡 with a beautifully crackly crust😍 Every slice carries a gentle salty fragrance that pairs perfectly with a fresh side salad🥗\n\n✤ 手工黑芝麻窩夫配黑芝麻雪糕 $118\n罕見的黑芝麻窩夫\n非常脆口帶芝麻香\n整體焙香出眾很棒\n𝐁𝐥𝐚𝐜𝐤 𝐬𝐞𝐬𝐚𝐦𝐞 𝐰𝐚𝐟𝐟𝐥𝐞 is crispy with every bite, bursting with that nutty sesame aroma🖤 The overall toasted fragrance is outstanding, making it incredibly addictive and seriously delicious🤤\n\n✤ 黑松露牛肝菌汁刺身帶子波浪粉 $158\n首嘗波浪粉很特別\n口感煙韌而且掛汁\n松露香氣散發出來\n𝐁𝐥𝐚𝐜𝐤 𝐭𝐫𝐮𝐟𝐟𝐥𝐞 and 𝐛𝐨𝐥𝐞𝐭𝐮𝐬 𝐜𝐫𝐞𝐚𝐦 𝐬𝐚𝐮𝐜𝐞 tossed with fresh scallop and wavy pasta — a beautiful, indulgent plate😋 Chewy with a satisfying Q-bite that clings beautifully to every drop of the rich, earthy sauce✨",
          "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
        },
        "originalText": {
